<title>PORTUGAL: Sonae Industria to make 12 bln esc capital call.</title>
<headline>Sonae Industria to make 12 bln esc capital call.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese wood products group Sonae Industria said it was raising nominal capital by 50 percent to 21 billion escudos through the issue of seven million new shares.</p>
<p>The shares will be priced at 1,700 escudos against the nominal value of 1,000 escudos, the company said in an announcement published in newspapers on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
